    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr. David Andai is a young doctor who is carving out a unique path that merges medicine with data science. Starting with a childhood love for technology, his journey led him to the Brain and Mind Institute, where he is making strides in brain health. In this Q&A, Dr. Andai shares how his passion for IT and medicine converged, what motivates him, and his vision for the future of healthcare. He also reflects on the mentors and milestones that have shaped his career.",
